1
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:44,640
Where are we going now, Brother Biao?

2
00:01:45,879 --> 00:01:46,400
East Street.

3
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:58,760
Target's heading to East Street.

4
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:00,120
Xiao Ding, pull up East Street.

5
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:00,640
On it.

6
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:01,239
All units, be advised.

7
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:02,719
The suspect is heading toward East Street.

8
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:03,280
Move in.

9
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,479
We're behind the suspect vehicle.

10
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:12,800
About 50 meters behind the suspect.

11
00:02:14,039 --> 00:02:15,759
That Mazda behind us is catching up.

12
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,080
Turn at the intersection ahead.

13
00:02:25,439 --> 00:02:25,800
Copy that.

14
00:02:26,719 --> 00:02:27,800
Suspect vehicle, a Mazda,

15
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,719
plate Chang D24653, is now behind us.

16
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:31,759
We'll break off pursuit on the road ahead,

17
00:02:34,479 --> 00:02:37,159
and enter East Street via Roman Avenue.

18
00:02:54,599 --> 00:02:55,360
Dongfeng Bridge.

19
00:02:57,479 --> 00:02:59,000
Brother Biao, something's off.

20
00:03:00,159 --> 00:03:01,719
That car's been tailing us the whole way.

21
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,719
Could the cops be onto us?

22
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:14,960
Can you tell your people

23
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,319
to hang back a little?

24
00:03:16,599 --> 00:03:18,199
Don't scare off our client.

25
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:23,919
Brother Biao, who is it?

26
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:25,919
You'll know when we get there.

27
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:49,280
Taking Guanghua Avenue now,

28
00:03:49,599 --> 00:03:50,800
coming out from Yinshi Road.

29
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,240
Captain Bai.

30
00:04:25,639 --> 00:04:27,199
The suspect circled south from Dongcheng,

31
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,480
and is now heading back north.

32
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,279
Captain Bai, we're on the Mazda now.

33
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:39,160
Approaching Weiyuan Avenue and Hongyou Road.

34
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,000
Once they hit Weiyuan Bridge,

35
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,199
they'll be heading out of town.

36
00:04:45,399 --> 00:04:47,800
I don't have time to play games with you.

37
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,560
Tell me where the deal is right now!

38
00:04:49,759 --> 00:04:51,160
Once you get to Changshan Dam,

39
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,879
you'll see the goods soon enough.

40
00:04:55,639 --> 00:04:56,720
Head to Changshan Dam.

41
00:05:09,199 --> 00:05:10,079
Pull up Changshan Dam.

42
00:05:10,399 --> 00:05:10,800
Copy that.

43
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,759
The road to Changshan Dam

44
00:05:28,519 --> 00:05:30,040
is completely deserted.

45
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:33,439
Plus, the dam area is wide open.

46
00:05:34,439 --> 00:05:35,759
Once our team moves in,

47
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,199
we'll be spotted easily.

48
00:05:39,439 --> 00:05:40,120
Li Qiang's men

49
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,720
should already be near the dam by now.

50
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,360
And we don't have time

51
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,160
to deploy in advance.

52
00:05:44,439 --> 00:05:46,800
Right now, besides Liang Wenbiao and Li Qiang,

53
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:49,000
there's that crew in the Mazda.

54
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:51,879
If the guy in that Mazda

55
00:05:52,639 --> 00:05:53,839
is Four-Legged Snake,

56
00:05:54,319 --> 00:05:56,279
he must've cut a deal with Liang Wenbiao

57
00:05:56,839 --> 00:05:58,879
to kick Li Qiang while he's down.

58
00:06:00,160 --> 00:06:01,319
You mean

59
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,120
he plans to hijack the shipment?

60
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:09,040
But the location Li Qiang arranged

61
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:10,879
is just as difficult for Liang Wenbiao

62
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:12,160
and Four-Legged Snake.

63
00:06:12,519 --> 00:06:14,920
Besides, if he sees that Liang Wenbiao

64
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,319
brought anyone else along,

65
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,319
he could call off the deal at any moment.

66
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,279
Notify Captain Shen.

67
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:23,120
Set up roadblocks outbound from Changshan Dam.

68
00:06:23,399 --> 00:06:24,759
We'll deploy on the fly

69
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:26,079
based on the Mazda's movements.

70
00:06:26,839 --> 00:06:28,519
Calling CID, calling CID.

71
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:43,519
Boss, it's right up ahead.

72
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:50,879
Listen up.

73
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:52,959
Once we get the goods,

74
00:06:53,519 --> 00:06:54,959
don't let that punk get away.

75
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:55,839
Brother Biao,

76
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,480
what do you mean?

77
00:06:58,040 --> 00:07:00,040
Aren't we... aren't we here to make a deal?

78
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,439
Didn't I tell you already?

79
00:07:02,639 --> 00:07:03,720
I want to make an extra cut.

80
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:08,079
Besides, that punk Li Qiang should've died long ago.

81
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:11,120
Trying to take me down comes with a price.

82
00:07:32,319 --> 00:07:33,319
After driving around for so long,

83
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,399
I thought they'd pick somewhere special.

84
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,000
Just this dump?

85
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:41,240
Don't stop yet. Circle around a couple of times.

86
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:19,920
Brother Qiang.

87
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:22,959
You sure kept me waiting forever.

88
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,120
Good things take time, right?

89
00:08:25,639 --> 00:08:26,720
Brother Biao doesn't strike me

90
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,079
as the impatient type.

91
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,600
I'm not impatient.

92
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:32,080
Just haven't seen you in so long,

93
00:08:32,279 --> 00:08:33,519
I really missed you.

94
00:08:39,559 --> 00:08:40,279
Hurry it up.

95
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,799
Don't keep Brother Biao waiting.

96
00:08:43,919 --> 00:08:44,399
Got it.

97
00:08:52,679 --> 00:08:54,679
Liang Wenbiao and Li Qiang are making the deal now.

98
00:08:55,679 --> 00:08:57,279
The Mazda has reached the reed field,

99
00:08:57,559 --> 00:08:59,360
about one kilometer from the scene.

100
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,320
Team B has eyes on them.

101
00:09:02,159 --> 00:09:03,759
Team A is at the intersection ahead,

102
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,159
covering the outbound route.

103
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:08,039
The CID has set up roadblocks as well.

104
00:09:09,279 --> 00:09:10,279
Right now, all the suspects

105
00:09:10,279 --> 00:09:11,559
are within our perimeter.

106
00:09:11,759 --> 00:09:13,240
Tell everyone to hold their positions.

107
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,360
Wait for word from Team B.

108
00:09:14,679 --> 00:09:15,039
Copy that.

109
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:30,840
Brother Biao.

110
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,159
What's this supposed to mean?

111
00:10:43,399 --> 00:10:44,480
I don't want your life.

112
00:10:44,879 --> 00:10:47,840
But I want both the cash and the goods.

113
00:10:56,679 --> 00:10:57,279
How about this?

114
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,440
Give me the cash and the goods,

115
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:01,600
and leave your life here too.

116
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:04,559
Have you lost your mind?

117
00:11:17,759 --> 00:11:18,639
It's an ambush!

118
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:22,000
Brother Biao!

119
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:37,480
All units,

120
00:11:37,879 --> 00:11:38,279
move in.

121
00:11:52,879 --> 00:11:53,440
Brother Biao!

122
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:00,559
The cops are here!

123
00:12:33,879 --> 00:12:34,799
Ah Wei!

124
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:37,120
Ah Wei!

125
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,679
B-Brother Biao's always suspected you.

126
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:03,960
He...

127
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:05,360
He...

128
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,159
He told me to tail you.

129
00:13:10,399 --> 00:13:13,000
I know your... your sister

130
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:15,559
has been in Nanhai City all along.

131
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:17,200
But...

132
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:22,240
But I didn't... didn't tell Brother Biao.

133
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:32,639
Forget him, let's get out of here!

134
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:34,360
Go!

135
00:13:34,519 --> 00:13:35,919
We're out of time!

136
00:13:35,919 --> 00:13:37,279
Hurry! Go!

137
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:40,720
Go!

138
00:13:42,039 --> 00:13:42,559
Drive!

139
00:14:06,639 --> 00:14:08,440
Pursue them. I'll have CID back you up.

140
00:14:08,679 --> 00:14:09,639
The suspect is crucial.

141
00:14:09,639 --> 00:14:11,039
Do not fire unless absolutely necessary.

142
00:14:11,159 --> 00:14:11,840
I want him alive.

143
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:12,200
Yes, sir.

144
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:12,960
Get in!

145
00:14:33,759 --> 00:14:34,559
Provide cover!

146
00:14:34,759 --> 00:14:35,639
The rest of you, follow me.

147
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:48,440
Freeze!

148
00:14:48,639 --> 00:14:49,639
Go, hurry!

149
00:14:53,039 --> 00:14:53,639
Wendi!

150
00:14:55,639 --> 00:14:56,639
Brother Qiang, go!

151
00:14:57,279 --> 00:14:58,720
We're running out of time!

152
00:14:58,919 --> 00:14:59,600
Just go!

153
00:15:00,759 --> 00:15:01,279
Wendi!

154
00:15:01,759 --> 00:15:02,559
Wendi!

155
00:15:05,639 --> 00:15:06,399
Go!

156
00:15:57,480 --> 00:15:58,960
The cops could catch up any second.

157
00:15:59,039 --> 00:16:00,360
You won't make it through this alone.

158
00:16:00,399 --> 00:16:01,200
Cops?

159
00:16:01,799 --> 00:16:03,919
How do I know you aren't a cop?

160
00:16:05,399 --> 00:16:06,519
You're Four-Legged Snake, Brother Si, right?

161
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:08,679
I'm with Liang Wenbiao.

162
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,799
Since you're working with Liang Wenbiao,

163
00:16:11,120 --> 00:16:12,519
you ought to know who his men are.

164
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:15,879
Liang Wenbiao told me

165
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:18,080
there might be a mole among his men.

166
00:16:18,399 --> 00:16:20,279
How do I know it isn't you?

167
00:16:21,399 --> 00:16:23,399
The mole in Brother Biao's crew was Chen Kang.

168
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:24,799
I took him out.

169
00:16:26,080 --> 00:16:27,360
For today's deal...

170
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:30,320
The cops showed up so fast,

171
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:31,840
which means they came prepared.

172
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:34,559
Someone definitely tipped them off.

173
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:36,159
Just now, like you,

174
00:16:36,559 --> 00:16:38,320
I fought my way out through a hail of police bullets.

175
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:40,200
You ever seen a cop risk his life like that?

176
00:16:40,519 --> 00:16:41,200
Not necessarily.

177
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:43,159
Plenty of cops aren't afraid to die.

178
00:16:58,799 --> 00:17:00,000
You two, head to the hospital.

179
00:17:00,399 --> 00:17:01,600
Guard the suspects around the clock.

180
00:17:01,840 --> 00:17:02,360
Yes, sir.

181
00:17:08,279 --> 00:17:08,680
Captain Bai.

182
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,759
Five criminals were killed at the scene.

183
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:12,319
Mai Wendi, Liang Wenbiao,

184
00:17:12,359 --> 00:17:14,440
and two unidentified individuals were severely injured,

185
00:17:14,519 --> 00:17:15,200
in critical condition.

186
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:16,839
No casualties among our officers.

187
00:17:27,799 --> 00:17:28,519
Where is Tian Xin?

188
00:17:29,039 --> 00:17:29,759
Where is Tian Xin?

189
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:31,400
Talk!

190
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:33,279
Where is Tian Xin? - Li Xiao, don't be reckless!

191
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:34,160
Talk!

192
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:35,480
Where is Tian Xin? - Calm down!

193
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:36,079
Don't be reckless!

194
00:17:36,119 --> 00:17:37,079
If he dies now... - I'm asking you!

195
00:17:37,079 --> 00:17:38,559
...we'll never find Tian Xin.

196
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:45,880
Li Xiao!

197
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:46,880
Let him go.

198
00:17:48,599 --> 00:17:49,599
We're about to catch up to them.

199
00:17:49,799 --> 00:17:50,400
Captain Bai said...

200
00:17:50,559 --> 00:17:51,359
...not to follow too closely.

201
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:53,559
The CID has set up roadblocks ahead.

202
00:17:53,759 --> 00:17:54,559
The suspects won't get away.

203
00:18:00,039 --> 00:18:00,480
Captain Shen.

204
00:18:01,559 --> 00:18:03,319
Two suspects are fleeing out of the city.

205
00:18:03,839 --> 00:18:05,440
Requesting two vehicles to intercept them.

206
00:18:06,079 --> 00:18:07,079
These suspects are crucial.

207
00:18:07,599 --> 00:18:08,519
Make sure to take them alive.

208
00:18:08,839 --> 00:18:09,559
Copy that. Copy that.

209
00:18:10,799 --> 00:18:11,279
Let's go.

210
00:18:13,119 --> 00:18:14,279
Everyone into the cars, move out!

211
00:18:14,559 --> 00:18:15,200
Get in!

212
00:18:36,519 --> 00:18:37,640
The highway entrance is just ahead.

213
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:38,920
The cops must've set up a roadblock.

214
00:18:39,519 --> 00:18:40,319
We're not getting away.

215
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:42,279
You're not thinking of surrendering, are you?

216
00:18:48,279 --> 00:18:48,720
Slow down!

217
00:18:48,799 --> 00:18:49,759
The cops are catching up!

218
00:18:49,759 --> 00:18:51,759
I told you to slow down! Did you hear me?!

219
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:52,720
Slow down!

220
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:58,440
Watch out!

221
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:02,559
You wanna chase me? Keep chasing!

222
00:19:05,559 --> 00:19:06,759
Stop the car! Hurry, stop!

223
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:07,559
Stop the car!

224
00:19:29,119 --> 00:19:29,680
Cops!

225
00:19:31,759 --> 00:19:32,359
Ram through!

226
00:19:32,480 --> 00:19:33,720
If we ram through, we'll all die!

227
00:19:34,559 --> 00:19:35,160
Stop the car!

228
00:19:35,200 --> 00:19:36,480
I said ram through, so ram through!

229
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:37,279
Ram through!

230
00:19:37,599 --> 00:19:38,240
Stop the car!

231
00:19:38,599 --> 00:19:39,400
Stop the car!

232
00:19:45,319 --> 00:19:45,839
Hold on!

233
00:19:46,440 --> 00:19:46,920
Stop the car!

234
00:20:08,359 --> 00:20:09,160
Everyone, spread out and search.

235
00:20:47,920 --> 00:20:48,559
Are you dead?

236
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:51,559
Are... are you dead?

237
00:20:52,799 --> 00:20:53,400
Good, you're still alive.

238
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:57,640
Get out of the car.

239
00:20:58,039 --> 00:20:59,200
The cops are almost here.

240
00:20:59,839 --> 00:21:00,400
Move!

241
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:01,920
Get out!

242
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:03,000
Move!

243
00:21:11,279 --> 00:21:12,480
Over here, quick!

244
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:46,359
Come here.

245
00:21:51,640 --> 00:21:52,119
Stop the car.

246
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:58,200
Get out.

247
00:22:05,440 --> 00:22:05,640
Get in.

248
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:09,839
Get in!

249
00:22:21,839 --> 00:22:22,240
Drive.

250
00:22:42,799 --> 00:22:43,799
Everyone, split up and keep searching.

251
00:23:04,240 --> 00:23:04,519
Get out of the car.

252
00:23:12,519 --> 00:23:14,200
Brother Si, who were they?

253
00:23:15,400 --> 00:23:16,680
Could be our own people.

254
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:19,720
Or maybe the cops.

255
00:23:21,279 --> 00:23:22,680
I'll stay at your place for a few days.

256
00:23:23,319 --> 00:23:23,960
As for this kid...

257
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:25,079
let's take him back first.

258
00:23:42,079 --> 00:23:43,079
In today's operation,

259
00:23:43,279 --> 00:23:45,599
we arrested drug dealers Liang Wenbiao, Mai Wendi, and others.

260
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:47,519
Five criminals were shot dead on the scene.

261
00:23:48,359 --> 00:23:50,599
Because the suspects changed the deal location last minute,

262
00:23:50,920 --> 00:23:52,279
our understanding of the pursuit scene

263
00:23:52,279 --> 00:23:53,200
was limited.

264
00:23:53,799 --> 00:23:55,680
So Li Qiang managed to escape again.

265
00:23:56,039 --> 00:23:59,200
Another unidentified suspect

266
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:00,880
took Wei Kai hostage and escaped.

267
00:24:02,480 --> 00:24:05,200
Li Qiang holds the lives of Zhuang Yan, Ge Dan,

268
00:24:05,359 --> 00:24:06,759
and Tian Xin in his hands.

269
00:24:07,119 --> 00:24:08,240
His escape this time

270
00:24:08,799 --> 00:24:10,240
serves as a wake-up call for us.

271
00:24:11,319 --> 00:24:12,440
Step up the citywide manhunt.

272
00:24:12,720 --> 00:24:14,160
Bring Li Qiang to justice as soon as possible.

273
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:16,880
Meanwhile, notify our officers at the hospital

274
00:24:17,079 --> 00:24:18,480
to keep a close eye on the suspects.

275
00:24:18,839 --> 00:24:20,400
Once they're out of critical condition,

276
00:24:20,519 --> 00:24:21,599
interrogate them immediately.

277
00:24:22,279 --> 00:24:23,960
Try to get from Mai Wendi

278
00:24:24,079 --> 00:24:25,160
the whereabouts of Li Qiang

279
00:24:25,359 --> 00:24:26,039
so we can locate Tian Xin.

280
00:24:26,319 --> 00:24:26,720
Yes, sir.

281
00:24:27,079 --> 00:24:29,720
Also, confirm as soon as possible whether the one holding Wei Kai

282
00:24:29,839 --> 00:24:30,880
is Four-Legged Snake.

283
00:24:31,599 --> 00:24:33,319
According to our prior intelligence,

284
00:24:33,599 --> 00:24:35,599
those teaming up with Liang Wenbiao against Li Qiang

285
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:36,920
are Four-Legged Snake's crew.

286
00:24:43,119 --> 00:24:43,920
It's CID on the line.

287
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:48,480
Bring him in right away.

288
00:24:50,640 --> 00:24:52,000
An hour ago, someone called the police

289
00:24:52,440 --> 00:24:54,519
reporting a carjacking on Canglong Road,

290
00:24:54,640 --> 00:24:55,680
right along the suspects' escape route.

291
00:24:56,160 --> 00:24:57,759
Our team is bringing the driver here right now.

292
00:25:01,759 --> 00:25:02,920
Have you reached Wei Kai yet?

293
00:25:04,400 --> 00:25:04,799
No.

294
00:25:06,000 --> 00:25:07,240
That's what worries me the most.

295
00:25:07,799 --> 00:25:10,160
The suspect took Wei Kai hostage

296
00:25:10,400 --> 00:25:12,200
most likely because they suspected his identity.

297
00:25:13,119 --> 00:25:15,640
So Wei Kai must be in serious danger right now.

298
00:26:02,640 --> 00:26:04,640
If it weren't for me, you'd have already...

299
00:27:12,680 --> 00:27:13,039
Sit down.

300
00:27:20,240 --> 00:27:20,559
Brother Si.

301
00:27:21,119 --> 00:27:22,440
How are you still in the mood to watch TV

302
00:27:25,480 --> 00:27:26,279
after something this big?

303
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:28,160
Let's see what the police have to say.

304
00:27:33,920 --> 00:27:34,559
Talk to me.

305
00:27:35,079 --> 00:27:37,079
How do you know Liang Wenbiao?

306
00:27:38,079 --> 00:27:39,200
I beat him up.

307
00:27:39,880 --> 00:27:40,799
That's how we met.

308
00:27:42,920 --> 00:27:45,319
Sounds just like Liang Wenbiao.

309
00:27:45,680 --> 00:27:47,359
Always doing things the hard way.

310
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:53,160
I told Liang Wenbiao before

311
00:27:53,279 --> 00:27:55,160
never to mention his dealings with me.

312
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:57,079
How did you find out?

313
00:27:58,960 --> 00:27:59,599
Just a hunch.

314
00:28:01,960 --> 00:28:06,359
Then you must've guessed what I do, too.

315
00:28:09,079 --> 00:28:10,519
You're Brother Biao's supplier.

316
00:28:11,519 --> 00:28:13,880
He gets all his goods from you, right?

317
00:28:19,599 --> 00:28:22,200
I sent Liang Wenbiao's men to collect the cash.

318
00:28:23,599 --> 00:28:24,680
Were you in on that?

319
00:28:27,799 --> 00:28:29,039
Right after they went for the money,

320
00:28:29,039 --> 00:28:30,920
the cops raided our hideout.

321
00:28:32,079 --> 00:28:33,920
Which means among Liang Wenbiao's men,

322
00:28:34,960 --> 00:28:36,119
there's an undercover cop.

323
00:28:37,519 --> 00:28:39,319
I think it was just a coincidence.

324
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:40,720
Though...

325
00:28:41,519 --> 00:28:43,640
Chen Kang, who was with us, was a cop.

326
00:28:44,839 --> 00:28:47,799
Didn't you say you'd already whacked him?

327
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:49,599
We now bring you a police bulletin.

328
00:28:49,799 --> 00:28:51,079
At 10:00 a.m. today,

329
00:28:51,359 --> 00:28:54,160
Nanhai police launched a major anti-drug operation.

330
00:28:54,519 --> 00:28:55,480
During the operation,

331
00:28:55,640 --> 00:28:57,640
police shot and killed several drug traffickers,

332
00:28:57,640 --> 00:28:59,799
seizing 18 kilograms of narcotics,

333
00:29:00,039 --> 00:29:01,559
marking a significant victory.

334
00:29:02,079 --> 00:29:02,960
Unfortunately,

335
00:29:03,200 --> 00:29:04,759
a police officer

336
00:29:04,759 --> 00:29:06,119
embedded undercover in the syndicate

337
00:29:06,279 --> 00:29:07,640
was killed in the line of duty.

338
00:29:08,559 --> 00:29:10,839
We pay our highest respects

339
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:12,960
to this unsung hero.

340
00:29:12,960 --> 00:29:16,200
Additionally, three suspects escaped during the raid,

341
00:29:16,200 --> 00:29:18,839
including key wanted fugitive Li Qiang.

342
00:29:19,200 --> 00:29:21,119
Police urge all citizens to stay alert...

343
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:21,720
Brother Si,

344
00:29:23,160 --> 00:29:25,160
this kid doesn't look like a cop.

345
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:31,440
You've got serious skills, kid.

346
00:29:31,799 --> 00:29:34,599
Why run with a useless bum like Liang Wenbiao?

347
00:29:35,839 --> 00:29:36,599
For money.

348
00:29:38,279 --> 00:29:40,599
Since you know he's useless,

349
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:42,480
why work with him?

350
00:29:49,039 --> 00:29:49,400
Gao Jian.

351
00:29:51,440 --> 00:29:52,920
Go check the hospital.

352
00:29:53,319 --> 00:29:56,319
See if Liang Wenbiao and Li Qiang's two men

353
00:29:56,799 --> 00:29:58,039
are actually dead.

354
00:29:58,920 --> 00:29:59,279
Got it.

355
00:30:06,119 --> 00:30:08,640
You two, keep your eyes on this kid.

356
00:30:08,880 --> 00:30:09,880
If he steps out of line,

357
00:30:10,079 --> 00:30:11,079
take him out.

358
00:30:11,680 --> 00:30:12,079
Understood.

359
00:32:09,400 --> 00:32:10,279
I'll go get the doctor.

360
00:33:06,559 --> 00:33:08,680
Boring. You win again.

361
00:33:12,400 --> 00:33:13,400
Something's up.

362
00:33:13,799 --> 00:33:14,440
Hurry up, move!

363
00:34:18,960 --> 00:34:20,239
Stop it! Stop it!

364
00:34:20,880 --> 00:34:22,239
Stop! Let go!

365
00:34:23,360 --> 00:34:25,360
Let him go! Let him go!

366
00:34:51,480 --> 00:34:52,360
What is wrong with you guys?

367
00:34:53,280 --> 00:34:54,679
I told you to teach Gu Xiaoyi a lesson,

368
00:34:55,199 --> 00:34:56,360
but instead, you made her call the police!

369
00:34:57,760 --> 00:34:59,559
We thought scaring her would be enough.

370
00:34:59,880 --> 00:35:01,199
Who knew she'd fight back so fiercely?

371
00:35:01,800 --> 00:35:03,119
And then some busybody had to butt in.

372
00:35:05,199 --> 00:35:06,119
I acted too hastily.

373
00:35:07,360 --> 00:35:08,960
I shouldn't have sent you in so soon.

374
00:35:16,119 --> 00:35:17,199
Looks like Nanhai City

375
00:35:18,400 --> 00:35:20,360
is really in for a heavy storm.

376
00:35:23,000 --> 00:35:25,119
How much does Gu Xiaoyi know about our business?

377
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:26,960
If she keeps digging like this,

378
00:35:27,760 --> 00:35:30,559
Longze Group will end up on the police's radar sooner or later.

379
00:35:31,960 --> 00:35:33,039
Still, what worries me most right now

380
00:35:33,039 --> 00:35:34,159
isn't Gu Xiaoyi.

381
00:35:35,280 --> 00:35:38,199
Guo Yingying and Zhang Xuebin may be dead,

382
00:35:39,199 --> 00:35:41,400
but the police must have

383
00:35:41,400 --> 00:35:42,760
noticed Zhongtian Logistics long ago.

384
00:35:44,079 --> 00:35:45,639
The boss wants to sacrifice pawns to save the king,

385
00:35:46,039 --> 00:35:46,960
but the deaths of those two

386
00:35:46,960 --> 00:35:48,599
won't protect us at all.

387
00:35:49,719 --> 00:35:52,079
You think the cops will trace it back to us?

388
00:36:00,480 --> 00:36:01,880
I'm starting to suspect

389
00:36:02,320 --> 00:36:03,480
that in the boss's eyes,

390
00:36:04,000 --> 00:36:05,880
just like Qian Feng and the others,

391
00:36:07,159 --> 00:36:08,480
I'm nothing more than a pawn.

392
00:36:08,679 --> 00:36:10,320
If I can't clean this mess up properly,

393
00:36:11,320 --> 00:36:12,920
I'll end up just like them.

394
00:36:15,599 --> 00:36:17,119
Four-Legged Snake can barely save himself now.

395
00:36:17,559 --> 00:36:18,880
I can only rely on you.

396
00:36:20,440 --> 00:36:21,800
Just say the word. What do you need me to do?

397
00:36:24,960 --> 00:36:27,880
I need you to deliver a letter to someone for me.

398
00:36:33,760 --> 00:36:36,719
Last night, Longze Group's new CFO,

399
00:36:36,719 --> 00:36:39,280
Gu Xiaoyi, reported that she was assaulted.

400
00:36:39,480 --> 00:36:40,760
According to her statement,

401
00:36:40,880 --> 00:36:42,639
we suspect Hu Dong and others

402
00:36:42,639 --> 00:36:43,920
from Longze Group's security team.

403
00:36:44,159 --> 00:36:45,239
The mastermind behind it

404
00:36:45,679 --> 00:36:48,320
is Chen Hai, the former CFO of Longze Group.

405
00:36:51,400 --> 00:36:52,559
What are the grounds for suspecting him?

406
00:36:53,519 --> 00:36:54,400
Gu Xiaoyi stated that

407
00:36:54,920 --> 00:36:56,880
at the request of Longze Group's chairman,

408
00:36:56,880 --> 00:36:57,920
Long Zhiyuan,

409
00:36:58,280 --> 00:36:59,559
she had conducted an audit into

410
00:36:59,719 --> 00:37:00,519
the group's financial issues.

411
00:37:01,079 --> 00:37:02,159
She discovered that

412
00:37:02,360 --> 00:37:04,599
Runze Commerce, a subsidiary of Longze Group,

413
00:37:04,840 --> 00:37:06,079
has major financial irregularities.

414
00:37:06,719 --> 00:37:08,239
She even suspects that Chen Hai

415
00:37:08,519 --> 00:37:09,960
has been using Longze Group

416
00:37:10,119 --> 00:37:11,840
for illegal money laundering.

417
00:37:15,800 --> 00:37:17,280
Gu Xiaoyi said that last week,

418
00:37:17,440 --> 00:37:18,960
she confronted Chen Hai about this.

419
00:37:19,280 --> 00:37:20,719
Chen Hai threatened her on the spot,

420
00:37:20,880 --> 00:37:22,079
telling her to mind her own business.

421
00:37:22,920 --> 00:37:24,039
I believe Chen Hai

422
00:37:24,599 --> 00:37:25,960
is finally feeling the heat.

423
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:31,840
Bring Chen Hai and Hu Dong in for questioning right away.

424
00:37:32,599 --> 00:37:33,000
Yes, sir.

425
00:37:33,519 --> 00:37:35,280
Bring them in for questioning

426
00:37:35,679 --> 00:37:36,400
to feel them out first

427
00:37:36,599 --> 00:37:38,039
and see if we can find any cracks.

428
00:37:38,800 --> 00:37:39,199
Understood.

429
00:37:44,559 --> 00:37:45,000
Hello.

430
00:37:46,119 --> 00:37:47,239
Hello, we're from the police department.

431
00:37:47,400 --> 00:37:48,519
Is Chen Hai in?

432
00:37:50,559 --> 00:37:51,039
Director Jiang.

433
00:37:54,199 --> 00:37:56,679
Can I help you with something?

434
00:37:57,360 --> 00:37:58,400
We'd like Mr. Chen Hai

435
00:37:58,559 --> 00:37:59,719
to come with us to assist in an investigation.

436
00:38:00,920 --> 00:38:03,119
Could you tell me what this is regarding?

437
00:38:03,280 --> 00:38:04,119
And you are?

438
00:38:04,679 --> 00:38:06,400
I'm the executive director of Longze Group.

439
00:38:06,519 --> 00:38:07,280
Hello.

440
00:38:07,760 --> 00:38:09,400
The matter is currently under investigation,

441
00:38:09,480 --> 00:38:10,440
so we cannot disclose any details.

442
00:38:10,960 --> 00:38:12,639
Also, please inform

443
00:38:12,800 --> 00:38:13,679
Hu Dong from your security team.

444
00:38:13,800 --> 00:38:15,000
He needs to come with us as well.

445
00:38:15,119 --> 00:38:15,599
All right.

446
00:38:15,840 --> 00:38:16,320
In addition,

447
00:38:16,320 --> 00:38:17,760
two of our officers will stay behind

448
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:19,440
to question everyone on the security team.

449
00:38:20,480 --> 00:38:21,320
How about this?

450
00:38:21,800 --> 00:38:23,480
You can head straight to the security office.

451
00:38:23,880 --> 00:38:25,960
I'll have the deputy head gather everyone

452
00:38:26,519 --> 00:38:27,519
to cooperate with your investigation.

453
00:38:27,840 --> 00:38:28,440
Um...

454
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:31,480
Director Jiang, Hu Dong took the day off today.

455
00:38:31,480 --> 00:38:33,719
He said family business came up and he'd be gone a few days.

456
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:34,519
He took leave?

457
00:38:35,760 --> 00:38:36,559
So, officers...

458
00:38:37,360 --> 00:38:38,280
Is Chen Hai here, then?

459
00:38:38,760 --> 00:38:39,119
Yes.

460
00:38:39,559 --> 00:38:40,199
He's in his office.

461
00:38:41,480 --> 00:38:42,360
Take them there.

462
00:38:42,559 --> 00:38:42,920
Yes, sir.

463
00:38:43,119 --> 00:38:43,880
This way, please.

464
00:38:55,440 --> 00:38:55,760
Come in.

465
00:38:57,000 --> 00:38:58,199
Mr. Chen, someone's here to see you.

466
00:38:58,320 --> 00:38:58,679
All right.

467
00:39:02,320 --> 00:39:02,800
Hello.

468
00:39:03,960 --> 00:39:05,559
Are you Mr. Chen Hai?

469
00:39:06,000 --> 00:39:06,440
Yes, that's me.

470
00:39:07,840 --> 00:39:08,920
We're from the Municipal Public Security Bureau.

471
00:39:09,079 --> 00:39:10,119
Please come with us

472
00:39:10,280 --> 00:39:11,079
to assist with our investigation.

473
00:40:06,199 --> 00:40:08,119
If I'd known you were a cop from the start,

474
00:40:11,639 --> 00:40:13,480
nothing ever would've started between us.

475
00:40:20,960 --> 00:40:22,800
But what am I supposed to do now?

476
00:40:31,360 --> 00:40:33,599
I can't convince myself to stop loving you,

477
00:40:36,599 --> 00:40:39,639
and I certainly can't convince you to stop being a cop.

478
00:40:56,360 --> 00:40:57,559
Can you promise me,

479
00:40:58,800 --> 00:41:00,079
no matter where you are in the future,

480
00:41:02,280 --> 00:41:03,960
whenever I need you,

481
00:41:05,280 --> 00:41:06,840
you'll be by my side?

482
00:41:09,000 --> 00:41:09,840
Can you do that?

483
00:41:25,760 --> 00:41:26,239
Captain.

484
00:41:26,639 --> 00:41:27,960
Zhao Ming brought Chen Hai in.

485
00:41:29,000 --> 00:41:29,519
Where's Hu Dong?

486
00:41:30,239 --> 00:41:31,800
Supposedly took leave to go home.

487
00:41:31,960 --> 00:41:32,760
Went home?

488
00:41:33,840 --> 00:41:34,519
Where's his hometown?

489
00:41:35,360 --> 00:41:36,960
Records show Shanxi.

490
00:41:40,079 --> 00:41:41,719
Gu Xiaoyi reported being threatened.

491
00:41:42,199 --> 00:41:44,119
Hu Dong's probably afraid we'll question him.

492
00:41:52,559 --> 00:41:53,800
Gu Xiaoyi's case is minor.

493
00:41:55,440 --> 00:41:56,760
It can't be because of that.

494
00:41:59,039 --> 00:42:00,519
CID searched Hu Dong's dorm

495
00:42:00,519 --> 00:42:02,239
and collected his trace evidence.

496
00:42:02,519 --> 00:42:04,400
Later, along with samples from the other guards,

497
00:42:04,400 --> 00:42:05,519
it'll be sent over to forensics.

498
00:42:17,519 --> 00:42:18,800
Ding Tao, come in for a second.

499
00:42:23,800 --> 00:42:25,159
Let's dig into Chen Hai's background first.

500
00:42:32,679 --> 00:42:33,719
Captain Bai, you wanted to see me?

501
00:42:34,960 --> 00:42:35,960
Look into something for me.

502
00:42:36,599 --> 00:42:37,920
Longze Group's security team.

503
00:42:38,119 --> 00:42:39,159
Get the background files on everyone.

504
00:42:39,159 --> 00:42:39,599
Yes, sir.

505
00:42:52,280 --> 00:42:53,719
Where were you the night before last?

506
00:42:55,000 --> 00:42:56,920
I stayed at home the entire night,

507
00:42:57,559 --> 00:42:58,639
watching TV with my wife.

508
00:43:00,239 --> 00:43:01,280
Then do you know

509
00:43:01,440 --> 00:43:03,119
where this Hu Dong went that night?

510
00:43:05,159 --> 00:43:06,360
I know Hu Dong,

511
00:43:06,559 --> 00:43:07,519
but we aren't close.

512
00:43:07,679 --> 00:43:09,800
He wouldn't tell me where he goes.

513
00:43:11,280 --> 00:43:12,800
Looks like Chen Hai came prepared.

514
00:43:16,480 --> 00:43:18,320
Contact the police in Shanxi.

515
00:43:18,519 --> 00:43:20,239
Have them check Hu Dong's hometown

516
00:43:20,559 --> 00:43:22,840
to see if he really went back.

517
00:43:23,280 --> 00:43:24,000
Right away.

518
00:43:28,079 --> 00:43:28,519
Captain Lu.

519
00:43:28,960 --> 00:43:30,119
Ask him about the drugs.

520
00:43:33,000 --> 00:43:33,960
Do you know Qian Feng?

521
00:43:35,079 --> 00:43:35,679
Yes.

522
00:43:36,519 --> 00:43:37,639
We've had meals together,

523
00:43:38,159 --> 00:43:39,239
but we're not that close.

524
00:43:40,719 --> 00:43:41,239
Not close?

525
00:43:43,840 --> 00:43:44,679
You worked together.

526
00:43:45,480 --> 00:43:46,719
You must be mistaken.

527
00:43:47,079 --> 00:43:48,960
Qian Feng doesn't even work for Longze.

528
00:43:54,280 --> 00:43:55,360
On suspicion of drug trafficking,

529
00:43:55,360 --> 00:43:56,320
Qian Feng has already been arrested.

530
00:43:56,880 --> 00:43:57,679
And according to his confession,

531
00:43:58,440 --> 00:43:59,480
you're his supplier.
